    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In its first year, Olivet boasted a general store, a hotel, a sawmill, and a wagon and blacksmith shop.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olivet%2C_Kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Olivet was incorporated as a city in 1870, just a year after its founding.",
